# Build context exclusions (DOCKER_IMAGE_STANDARDS.md §11).
# Keeps the context small so builds are fast and images reproducible.
.git
.github
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
tests
**/tests
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py
data
logs
out
**/data
**/logs
**/out
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.sqlite3
docs
**/docs
*.md
!README.md
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/deploy/vps/render.json
**/deploy/vps/generated
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
